<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2020_7547.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> willige dienst, und
<lb n="2"/>was wir mehr ehren liebs und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> vermögend,
<lb n="3"/>zuvor, fürsichtig, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weise</unclear>, besonders liebe
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gute</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbaurn</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Für</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deroselben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>: <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarlichen</unclear> und
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vertrauwlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">avis</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">betreffende</unclear> die durch-
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">paßierten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">landtsknecht</unclear>, und die continuation
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dises</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">paßes</unclear> so thuen wir uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bedanckhen</unclear>.
<lb n="10"/>Und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">füegen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">antwort</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ebenmeßiger</unclear> wol-
<lb n="11"/>meinung, und auß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gueter</unclear> nit
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ungewüßer</unclear> nachrichtung, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvernemmen</unclear>, daß
<lb n="13"/>die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">landtsknecht</unclear>, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bißher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">durchpaßiert</unclear>, in
<lb n="14"/>der <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoßschafft</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nirgends</unclear> an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kheinem</unclear> ort
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">außgehalten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>, sondern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gotthart</unclear></persName>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">albereit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">über</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">paßiert</unclear> sind.
<lb n="17"/>Ob aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">paß</unclear> noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">monat</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>offen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stehen</unclear>, oder ihnen die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">repaßierung</unclear> zu-
<lb n="19"/>gelaßen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seyn</unclear> solle, darvon haben wir
<lb n="20"/>kein gewüßheit, und der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angedeüten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">re</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">paßierung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halber</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schöpffen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwar</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">keine</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ungleiche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedanckhen</unclear>, und aber, dieweil
<lb n="23"/>(<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>: selber auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meldung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuend</unclear>.)
<lb n="24"/>solche sachen nit auß der acht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuschlahen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halben</unclear> berichten wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getreüwe</unclear> liebe
<lb n="26"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoßen</unclear> der statt Zürich</orgName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> warnung
<lb n="27"/>bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eigenem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leüffersbotten</unclear>, mit begeren,
<lb n="28"/>so ihnen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßhalber</unclear> etwas in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüßenschafft</unclear> seyn
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mögte</unclear>, uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unbeschwert</unclear> zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">avisieren</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2020_7548.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">was</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainiß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herüber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> in antwort
<lb n="31"/>ervolgt, daßselbig und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söcher</unclear> sachen
<lb n="32"/>halber weiter anlangen möchte, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sol</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jeder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unverbergen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bleiben</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/>wie wir dann gegen denselben unß hin-
<lb n="35"/>wider versehen, und sie deßhalb freündt-
<lb n="36"/>nachbarlich ersuochen, sie werden und wellen,
<lb n="37"/>waß ihnen söcher sachen halber weiter für-
<lb n="38"/>komen möchte, unß desselbigen gleichen
<lb n="39"/>gestalt auch vertreüwenlich berichten.
<lb n="40"/>Indem dessen bevelchend wir sie und unß
<lb n="41"/>der protection deß allerhöchsten. Data
<lb n="42"/><origDate when="1616" resp="#ner">den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">20</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Julii</unclear> anno 1616</origDate>.
<lb n="43"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">B. und Rhat</orgName>
<lb n="44"/>An die von <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Lindauw</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2020_7549.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2020_7550.jpg" n="4"/>
</p>
